  {
    "id": "A3",
    "section": "About page / Your story",
    "where": "Paragraph 1",
    "current": "The founder of Shree Ganesh, Shri Vrajlal Manilal Shah, had a vision he called \"Quality Vision.\" Gifted with foresight and sharp business acumen, he was the first to identify the potential of the fast-growing ready masala market. In 1969, he introduced \"Shree Ganesh Masala.\""
  },
  {
    "id": "A4",
