  },
  {
    "id": "A6",
    "section": "About page / Your story",
    "where": "Paragraph 2",
    "current": "Since the company began, quality has been our guiding force. We believe healthy cooking is the foundation of a healthy life, and our masalas carry a Quality Assurance for healthy cooking without compromising on taste and aroma."
  },
  {
    "id": "A7",
    "section": "About page / Your story",
    "where": "Paragraph 3",
    "current": "Spices, premium masalas and instant mixes hold a special place in our customers' hearts because we understand their needs. Recognising the demand for products that keep up with changing times and busier lifestyles, we launched \"Shree Ganesh Instant Mix.\""
  },
  {
